    "title": "Portland State University student killed in Highway 217 crash by distracted driver - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Julia Lopez ,\n3 hours ago BEAVERTON Ore. (KPTV) - A 21-year-old Portland State University student was killed in a crash on Highway 217 this weekend. Police say the driver responsible was distracted by his cell phone. “Please take a deep breath before you drive and just drive carefully,” said Jessica Altman-Pollack, Diana Minko’s mother.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
